## Summary
This article lists 50 commonly used phrases in Korean dramas and movies, providing their English meanings and Korean translations. It aims to help viewers understand and learn popular expressions from Korean entertainment media. The phrases cover a range of emotions and everyday situations often depicted in these shows.

## Key Points
- The article compiles a list of frequent phrases from Korean dramas and movies for educational purposes.
- Phrases include emotional, casual, and dramatic expressions commonly seen in Korean media.
- It serves as a resource for learning basic Korean language elements popular in entertainment.
- The list highlights cultural and linguistic aspects of Korean dramas and movies.
- It provides both English and Korean versions to aid comprehension.


